			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Guide\n\n1. [[Take notes on the Chapel about the Angels Number and Order.canvas|Take notes on the Chapel about the Angels Number and Order]]\n2. Unlock the [[Outer Room.canvas|Outer Room]] and draft the [[Tomb.canvas|Tomb]]\n3. Interact with the angels statues in the same order that they are listed on the Chapel based on the numbers.\n4. This will open a secret passage that leads to the [[Abandoned Mine.canvas|Abandoned Mine]].",
